note Numbers mirror aienos-infer (src/math.rs, src/quant.rs, src/decode.rs, src/lib.rs) on its plain f32
note path: same operations in the same order, one IEEE rounding per word, no fused multiply-add.
note omc refuses a function that returns f32 (error 5), so float helpers return the f32 bits as uint.
